              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigh pkiryot chi anka tïkwïl nyo ki wow ompö kongwa nko werïngwa nko werïngwa nyo mïnïng ighisyewutkökwa cho kikitö, kïle ato kigh werkökwa cho le tïsï cho pö ara Aron, kïsïwïyi pöytoghintö Daudi nko Sadok nko Aimelek nko yetïntino ortïn cho pö tïsï nko cho pö pipö Lawi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
